{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o123a","title":"武昌报麒麟孙权以赤乌为嘉祥改元步夫人卒追皇后","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o123a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"武昌报麒麟孙权以赤乌为嘉祥改元步夫人卒追皇后","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o123a-q"]},{"id":"feipin-a-51076d3e8eabe0255d6f","label":"正文","text":"步夫人薨后追授后号，顾雍奉策印（策全文）","evidence":["feipin-q-aafe5b249cdf7dc8deb2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"改元","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o123a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0093","role":"卒被追尊","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o123a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0045","role":"奉策者","evidence":["feipin-q-aafe5b249cdf7dc8deb2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":238,"label":"秋八月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y238","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o121","basis":"秋八月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o123a-q","wuzhu-q-o121","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o123a-q","source_order":[47,634,"O123a"],"order":8339}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0045","name":"顾雍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0093","name":"步氏（孙权夫人）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-aafe5b249cdf7dc8deb2","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-6f6ca26e87a44bb8c285","layer":"original","quote":"及薨，臣下缘权指〖7〗，请追正名号。乃赠印绶，策命曰：“惟赤乌元年闰月戊子〖8〗，皇帝曰：呜呼皇后！惟后佐命，共承天地；虔恭夙夜，与朕均劳。内教修整，礼义不愆〖9〗；宽容慈惠，有淑懿之德：民臣悬望，远近归心。朕以世难未夷，大统未一；缘后雅志，每怀谦损：是以于时，未授名号。亦必谓后降年有永〖10〗，永与朕躬对扬天休〖11〗。不悟奄忽〖12〗，大命近止；朕恨本意，不早昭显；伤后殂逝，不终天禄〖13〗。愍悼之至，痛于厥心！今使使持节、丞相、醴陵（亭）侯雍〖14〗，奉策授号，配食先后〖15〗。魂而有灵，嘉其宠荣。呜呼哀哉！”","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":261,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o123a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-0526f0e9023ccf679570","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，武昌言麒麟现〖1〗。有司奏言：“麒麟者，太平之应，宜改年号。”诏曰：“间者赤乌集于殿前〖2〗，朕所亲见。若神灵以为嘉祥者，改年宜以赤乌为元。”群臣奏曰：“昔武王伐纣〖3〗，有赤乌之祥〖4〗；君臣观之，遂有天下：圣人书策，载述最详者。以为近事既嘉，亲见又明也。”于是改年。步夫人卒〖5〗，追赠皇后。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o121","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-31d80fea6e868f721c62","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌元年春，铸当千大钱。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
